hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1106","Ahmad bin Abdul Rahman bin Wahb told us, my uncle told me, Muawiyah, who is Ibn Salih, told me on the authority of Shurayh bin Ubaid, on the authority of Abdul Rahman Ibn Jubayr Ibn Nufayr, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Thawban, the servant of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: We were with the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. He said the salutation while on a journey, and said: “This journey is effort and heaviness, so if one of you prays the Witr prayer, let him perform two rak’ahs, and if he wakes up, they are for him.”"
